{"key": "1bbfeee3aab4ca894a8f5dbd", "response": {"id": "msg_011CgAaJSGUu39SR6wPx8M1T", "container": null, "content": [{"text": "**No market prices a big tariff escalation. The tariff-checks contract is a bad match: it resolves on $1000 tariff-funded payments reaching a million Americans, not on escalation.**\n\nIf it happens, the template (unpriced, unreviewed, no probability) shows a typical hit of about -$2.3k, or 2.3% of the book. The average is -$4.1k, and the worst episode, Liberation Day 2025, was -$13.6k. QQQ and NVDA take most of it, and TSLA's thin margins make it the most exposed name. Its earnings land 2026-10-21, so headlines would stack on that swing.\n\nWant me to price a hedge on QQQ and NVDA, or look for a closer market, such as a semiconductor tariff?", "type": "text"}], "diagnostics": null, "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_details": null, "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 3889}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3889, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2631, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4, "iterations": [{"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 3889}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3889, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2631, "input_tokens": 4, "model": null, "output_tokens": 249, "type": "message"}], "output_tokens": 249, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}}
